    "translation": "To all our valued business partners:\nWe sincerely thank you for your continued patronage. This is the Sales Department of Sakura Foods Co., Ltd. With the cost of raw materials and shipping continuing to rise, we have until now maintained our prices through internal efforts; however, it is with great reluctance that we must raise the prices of all frozen food products by an average of eight percent, starting with orders placed on or after September 1. The size of the increase varies by product, and the details can be confirmed in the new price list. We ask for your kind understanding of the circumstances.\nPlease note that for orders received by August 31, the current prices will apply even if delivery takes place in September or later. Furthermore, for customers with an annual contract, there will be no price change until the contract period ends. Our representatives will deliver the new price list to you by August 10, so if you have any questions, please contact your representative.\nWe will continue striving to improve quality, and we ask for your continued patronage.",
