    "translation": "Subject: Request for a quotation for laptop computers\nMidori Electric Co., Ltd., Corporate Sales Department\nThis is my first time contacting you. My name is Okada, of the General Affairs Department at Sasaki Foods. I saw on your website that you sell to corporate customers, and I am writing to you for that reason.\nBecause the laptops our employees use have grown old, we plan to replace one hundred of them all at once next January. Could we therefore ask you for a quotation under the following conditions?\nFor the model, we would like one weighing 1.5 kg or less with a 14-inch screen. Our staff often carry them outside the company, so we place importance on light weight. For the warranty, please include a three-year extended warranty rather than the usual one year. Also, please let us know whether you can take back our hundred old computers and, if so, what that would cost.\nWe are requesting quotations from several companies under the same conditions and plan to decide on one company by the end of November, based on price and service. We would appreciate receiving your quotation by October 31.\nIf anything is unclear, please reply to this email. Thank you very much.",
