    "translation": "Subject: Notice of cancellation of the \"Autumn Management Seminar\" and our apologies\nTo everyone who applied\nThank you for your continued support. This is the seminar office of Hikari Industries.\nThe \"Autumn Management Seminar\" scheduled for Thursday, October 8 at Minato Hall has been cancelled, following the forecast that a large typhoon will make landfall that day and putting your safety first. We deeply apologize to everyone who was looking forward to it.\nRegarding the participation fee you have paid, you may choose between two options. The first is a full refund of the fee. The second is a transfer to an online seminar with the same content, to be held on Thursday, November 12. In the online seminar, more time will be set aside for questions to the lecturers than was planned for the venue. In either case, please let us know your preference by replying to this email by the end of this month. If we do not hear from you, we will refund the full amount.\nThe materials that were to be handed out on the day will be mailed to everyone who wishes to receive them, regardless of which option they choose. Once again, we apologize for the inconvenience.",
